  "description": "The two beautys on campus are A-Rang and Han-Se.\n\nThe two accidentally bump into each other, and end up having a drunken one-night stand. After that, A-Rang feels awkward and avoids Han-Se, but Han-Se, who doesn't appreciated being ghosted, begins to bully A-Rang when he sees him in class.Feeling stressed, A-Rang suddenly collapses and is rushed to hospital, where he gets unexpected news...\n\n\"I'm pregnant? But I'm a guy!\"\n\nHan-Se is the father?! Officials scramble to begin research at the news of male pregnancy, and A-Rang and Han-Se, the subjects of the study, are forced to start living together.\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
